<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse index closes higher in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse index closes higher in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange index closed 0.31 percent higher on Friday in quiet trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 606.59, up from 604.73 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade volume fell to 1.06 million dinars from 1.25 million dinars a day earlier.</p>
<p>Airline Tunis Air eased 0.56 dinar to 18.19 dinars. ($=0.98 dinar)</p>
